  "title": "Sweet Apple-Walnut Chicken Salad",
  "description": "Grilled chicken is tossed with apple, candied walnuts, and blue cheese in raspberry vinaigrette to deliver a sweet topping to a large plate of salad greens.",
  "authors": [
    "Scott K"
  ],
